    "created_at": "2019-07-30T19:17:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-07-30T19:17:53Z",
    "body": "https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D39928 has a test for all the defined mappings. `middle` is a bit magic requiring special CSS values in both Gecko and WebKit. Maybe we should standardize the name of that value.\r\n\r\nAlso, WebKit and Blink don't seem to map `abscenter` to `middle` (they don't seem to map it at all). That seems wrong per spec, but maybe if nobody is relying on it (why would they? `center` maps to the same thing) we could remove it from the spec.\r\n\r\nI've kept it in the test for now though.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
